                                "sense_id": "20f64745-6a67-3b99-8dd7-9f4e9ffd37de",
                                "text": "Hawaii, Obama’s childhood home, is the most diverse state in the Union: 21 percent of residents identified as “Hapa,” a Hawaiian word meaning “half” that has gone from being a slur against mixed-race Asians to a point of pride — and has increasingly been adopted by multiracials of all kinds on the Mainland."
